---
import Layout from '../../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Approach from '../../components/Approach.astro';
---
<Layout title={"About Game Nock | Game Development Studio"} description={"Game Nock is a game development studio working worldwide with studios, publishers and funded founders."} active="about" contact={true}>
<section class="pg-hero"><div class="wrap"><nav class="crumbs" aria-label="Breadcrumb"><a href="/">Home</a><span aria-hidden="true">/</span><span aria-current="page">About</span></nav><span class="eyebrow">About Game Nock</span><h1>A Dependable Development Partner for Ambitious Games.</h1><p class="lede">Our mission is to give studios and ambitious teams a dependable development partner capable of turning approved ideas into playable, scalable products.</p></div></section><Approach /><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Our story</span><h2>What We Do</h2></div><div class="glass prose" style="max-width:900px"><p>Game Nock is a game development studio working in Unity. We build complete games for founders and studios, add production capacity to existing teams, and take on focused engineering work such as multiplayer, backend systems and optimisation.</p>
      <p>Our work spans interactive entertainment for young families, competitive mobile multiplayer and vehicle combat with blockchain integration, across iOS, Android, PC, WebGL and VR.</p>
      <p style="margin:0">We are growing towards long-term partnerships with studios and publishers who value senior technical involvement and clear production over sheer headcount.</p></div></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Leadership</span><h2>Who Leads the Work</h2></div><div class="glass founder" style="max-width:900px"><span class="avatar" role="img" aria-label="Photo of Muhammad Hasham to be added">MH</span>
      <div><h3 style="font-size:26px;margin:0 0 4px">Muhammad Hasham</h3><p style="color:var(--cyan);font-family:var(--display);font-weight:600;margin:0 0 12px">Founder and Director</p>
      <p style="margin:0">Muhammad leads Game Nock’s technical direction and production. He works directly with clients on planning and architecture and stays involved in Unity engineering and delivery, so every project has senior technical oversight from the first review to release.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="g2"><div class="glass"><span class="eyebrow">Our team</span><h2 class="ttl">Disciplines Under One Roof</h2><ul class="facts"><li>Unity engineering</li><li>Backend engineering</li><li>Game art</li><li>UI/UX</li><li>QA</li><li>Production</li></ul></div>
      <div class="glass"><span class="eyebrow">Availability</span><h2 class="ttl">Working Worldwide, 24/7</h2><p>We work with clients across time zones, with agreed overlap hours for meetings and reviews, written weekly updates and professional production practices.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="sp "><div class="wrap"><div class="sec-head"><span class="eyebrow">Operating principles</span><h2>How We Behave on Every Project</h2></div><div class="g3"><div class="glass"><span class="gic"><svg><use href="#people"/></svg></span><h3>Transparent communication</h3><p>Regular updates and honest status, including bad news.</p></div><div class="glass"><span class="gic"><svg><use href="#chart"/></svg></span><h3>Responsible scope management</h3><p>Clear estimates, and changes agreed before work starts.</p></div><div class="glass"><span class="gic"><svg><use href="#search"/></svg></span><h3>Early risk identification</h3><p>Problems raised as soon as we see them, with options.</p></div><div class="glass"><span class="gic"><svg><use href="#user"/></svg></span><h3>Ownership of delivery</h3><p>We take responsibility for what we build.</p></div><div class="glass"><span class="gic"><svg><use href="#cube"/></svg></span><h3>Respect for confidentiality</h3><p>NDAs honoured and client work never shared without permission.</p></div><div class="glass"><span class="gic"><svg><use href="#team"/></svg></span><h3>Long-term partnership</h3><p>We plan for the release after this one, not just the next milestone.</p></div></div></div></section>
</Layout>
